  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Media for Life Saving Information in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to empower Sudanese with independent, life-saving information, strengthen media for accountability, enhance resilience, and contribute to future peace and democracy in Sudan.

Pillar 1: BUILD &#x2013; Improved access to independent, trustworthy information for Sudanese citizens through content production and distribution via Radio Dabanga and Sudan Media Forum (SMF) members, including in collaboration.

Pillar 2: GROW &#x2013; Increased quality of journalism, media and audience strategies through peer-to-peer knowledge exchange, learning and capacity development of involved Sudanese stakeholders. 

Pillar 3: ENGAGE &#x2013; Increased engagement of Sudanese NGOs and international stakeholders with the information and actions vital for Sudan&#x2019;s peaceful and democratic future through a series of advocacy, networking and coordination events and activities co-organised by FPU, Radio Dabanga and SMF.</narrative>
  </description>
